        "raw": "<p>If you didn&#39;t watch the newest twitch episode yesterday, shame on you ;P</p><p>Here are some news, a card of Knyfe was changed.&nbsp;</p><p>Focusing Conduit-Blade reads &quot;When this card is destroyed, you may play an quipment card&quot;.&nbsp;</p><p>The new text is &quot;After this card is destroyed...&quot;, now it&#39;s possible to play a second Focusing Conduit-Blade right after the first one.</p><p>i like the change, wooohooo ;P</p>",
