        "id": 199294,
        "name": "Natediggadoggity",
        "username": "Natediggadoggity",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/f04885/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-25T05:23:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m excited as KNYFE was really starting to fall flat for me. Starting with only 4 cards in hand, she tends to run out of them fairly quickly. And I’d often get 2-3 copies of that conduit blade, and no other equipment to use it on.</p>\n<p>She’s also fairly self destructive, with no healing. But hopefully the ability to combo with her more often will make her fun for me to play again.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:27:22.240Z",
